# The libc16 members each arithmetic test program links
# (tests/check-members). Helpers whose results are the same for signed
# and unsigned operands share a member; the 64-bit divides share u8div.

arith: cstart i4m i4d u4d i8m i8d u8d u8div i8ls i8rs u8rs
regs:  cstart i4m i4d u4d i8m i8d u8d u8div i8ls i8rs u8rs
lmul:  cstart i4m
lldiv: cstart i8d u8div
